{"about":["Note: This product is also available as part of a bundle. Please take care to avoid duplicate purchases.","Survival is just the beginning.","Six years have passed since the biological disaster in Raccoon City.","Agent Leon S. Kennedy, one of the survivors of the incident, has been sent to rescue the president's kidnapped daughter.","He tracks her to a secluded European village, where there is something terribly wrong with the locals.","And the curtain rises on this story of daring rescue and grueling horror where life and death, terror and catharsis intersect.","Featuring modernized gameplay, a reimagined storyline, and vividly detailed graphics,","Resident Evil 4 marks the rebirth of an industry juggernaut.","Relive the nightmare that revolutionized survival horror.","* Information for EU Consumers:","Important information for consumers residing in the European Union is available at:https://manual.capcom.com/information-for-eu-consumers/re4/","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function"],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/qv6AsSCT8cemAD138eKidL51.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/qv6AsSCT8cemAD138eKidL51.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/Zxh8NsrqsVzvQblfe4uIZCCg.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/Zxh8NsrqsVzvQblfe4uIZCCg.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/6j5JaZ3n5k8JDUBRlh8p8YwX.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/6j5JaZ3n5k8JDUBRlh8p8YwX.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/D6Xht9lPH4hB4lR2Yqnk35eK.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202210/2104/D6Xht9lPH4hB4lR2Yqnk35eK.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/v